The comments of the Lean files and the documents of this product quote statements and sentences of the paper named
above, which lies in this folder as paper.pdf. The paper is included under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This product depends on, but does not include, Lean 4 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4) and
mathlib4 with its standard dependency set, fetched by the build tool from their public repositories at the
revisions pinned in lake-manifest.json: batteries, aesop, Qq, ProofWidgets4, import-graph, LeanSearchClient and
plausible are released under the Apache License, Version 2.0; Cli (leanprover/lean4-cli) is released under the
MIT License (Copyright (c) 2021 mhuisi). None of these dependencies is included in this product.

The blueprint of this folder (the folder blueprint/, BlueprintMain.lean, informal-claims.json,
scripts/ci-pages.sh and ../.github/workflows/vp-vnp-blueprint.yml) was added in the fork
eric-vergo/formal-math by Eric Vergo and Claude (Anthropic). Its pages quote and adapt statements and
sentences of the paper and show the Lean files of this product; it is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. It depends on, but does not include, Verso Blueprint, Verso and SubVerso (in the versions of the
forks at https://github.com/eric-vergo, released under the Apache License, Version 2.0) and their
dependencies, fetched by the build tool at the revisions pinned in lake-manifest.json and released under their
own licenses. The proof does not depend on any of them.

